elow.\n\n| Sequence | Name            |\n| -------- | --------------- |\n| `\\n`     | New line        |\n| `\\r`     | Return carriage |\n| `\\t`     | Tab             |\n| `\\f`     | Form-feed       |\n| `\\v`     | Vertical tab    |\n| `\\b`     | Backspace       |\n| `\\a`     | Alert           |\n| `\\\"`     | Double quotes   |\n| `\\e`     | Escape          |\n| `\\\\`     | Backslash       |\n\nExample\n```\n\"I can use quotes inside a quoted string:\\n\\t\\\"Look!\\\"\"\n```\n\n### Comments\nComments start with `:x` and last until the end of the line.\n```\n:x I am a comment\n```\n\n## Bugs\nIf you find any bugs, please create an issue and report them.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
